ecosystem.config.json [api]: out_file not migrated: devlanes keeps every service's output
ecosystem.config.json [api]: max_memory_restart not migrated: devlanes does not restart processes
ecosystem.config.json [api]: port 4000 is now the lane's port (${{ self.port }}, also in PORT), so lanes do not collide
ecosystem.config.json [api]: local addresses of other services now use their lane ports: 5173 (web)
ecosystem.config.json [web]: wait_ready/listen_timeout are not migrated; add a ready check
ecosystem.config.json [web]: port 5173 is now the lane's port (${{ self.port }}, also in PORT), so lanes do not collide
